  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Bump pydantic-ai to 2.51.0 and drop Python 3.10 by @ggozad in https://github.com/ggozad/oterm/pull/336\n* Fix regenerate, simplify the codebase, correct the docs by @ggozad in https://github.com/ggozad/oterm/pull/337\n* Turn thinking off on OpenAI-compatible endpoints by @ggozad in https://github.com/ggozad/oterm/pull/338\n* Show context used against the model's context window by @ggozad in https://github.com/ggozad/oterm/pull/339\n* Add a summarize capability sized to the model's context window by @ggozad in https://github.com/ggozad/oterm/pull/340\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ggozad/oterm/compare/0.24.0...0.25.0",
